---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html><html lang="de"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#03243d"/><title>Pirate Deck · Tula’s Island</title><link rel="stylesheet" href={`${base}pirate-deck.css`}/></head><body>
<div class="app" id="app"><header class="hud"><button class="circle" aria-label="Zurück">‹</button><div class="brand"><small>TULA’S ISLAND</small><b>PIRATE DECK</b></div><div class="chip"><span>🐚</span><b id="shells">0</b></div></header>
<section class="bossbar"><div class="bossbar-top"><div><small>LEVEL 1 · PIRATENBOSS</small><strong>Pirat Kai</strong></div><b class="hptext" id="bossHpText">24 / 24</b></div><div class="health"><i id="bossHp"></i></div></section>
<main class="battle"><section class="boss-stage"><img class="boss-img" src={`${base}pirat-kai.svg`} alt="Pirat Kai"/><div class="boss-copy"><span class="boss-kicker">BOSSFIGHT</span><strong class="boss-name">Pirat Kai</strong><div class="taunt" id="taunt">„Na los, Inselkröte! <b>Zeig mir deine Wortkraft.</b>“</div></div></section><div class="field-title"><span>KAIS CREW</span><span>3 KARTENPLÄTZE</span></div><div class="lanes" id="enemyLanes"><div class="slot">FREI</div><div class="slot">FREI</div><div class="slot">FREI</div></div><div class="field-title"><span>DEINE CREW</span><span>TIPPE UNTEN EINE KARTE</span></div><div class="lanes" id="playerLanes"><div class="slot">DEIN PLATZ</div><div class="slot">DEIN PLATZ</div><div class="slot">DEIN PLATZ</div></div><div class="playerbar"><div class="player-info"><small>TULA · ❤️ <span id="playerHp">20</span></small><div class="health player"><i id="playerHpBar"></i></div></div><div><small>WELLENKRAFT</small><div class="energy" id="energy"></div></div></div></main>
<section class="hand"><div class="hand-title"><small>DEINE HAND</small><small>KARTE ANTIPPEN</small></div><div class="cards" id="cards"></div><div class="footer-actions"><button class="end" id="endTurn">⚔️ ZUG BEENDEN</button><button class="mini" id="restart" aria-label="Neu starten">↻</button></div></section><div class="log" id="log">Spiele eine Karte. Richtige Übersetzungen machen sie stärker.</div></div>
<div class="learn" id="learn"><div class="sheet"><small>KARTEN-MEISTERSCHAFT · DE → EN</small><h2 id="questionTitle">Was bedeutet …?</h2><p id="questionCopy"></p><div class="answers" id="answers"></div><div class="mastery" id="mastery">Richtig = voller Karteneffekt. Falsch = die Karte wird schwächer gespielt und Kai bekommt einen Vorteil.</div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="intro"><div class="intro"><div class="intro-hero"><img src={`${base}pirat-kai.svg`} alt="Pirat Kai"/><img src="https://o-some.github.io/tulasisland/assets/illustrations/tula-anime.svg" alt="Tula"/></div><small>TULA’S ISLAND PRÄSENTIERT</small><h1>Pirate Deck</h1><p>Baue deine Crew, löse Sprachkarten und besiege die Piratenbosse. Jede richtige Antwort verstärkt deinen Zug.</p><div class="boss-path" aria-label="Bossfortschritt"><i class="boss-dot active"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i><i class="boss-dot"></i></div><button id="start">⚔️ DUELL GEGEN PIRAT KAI</button><span class="note">Deutsch → Englisch · Mobile Battle Prototype</span></div></div>
<script src={`${base}pirate-deck.js`} defer></script></body></html>